msgstr "X"

#. module: interior_design
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:interior_design.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າໃຊ້ງານທຸກແອັບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ໜ້າຫຼັກ (Dashboard)."

#. module: interior_design
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:interior_design.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You should be able to execute the following flows to get an overview of the "
"various processes you can quickly run with this package using Odoo."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດທົດລອງດຳເນີນຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງພາບລວມຂອງຂະບວນການຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອ"
"ງໄວດ້ວຍແພັກເກດນີ້ເທິງ Odoo."

#. module: interior_design
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:interior_design.contactus
msgid ""
"Your data is protected by advanced encryption and\n"
"                                            security protocols, keeping "
"your\n"
"                                            personal information safe."
